  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DANIDA SPA 2022 Myanmar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">- In Myanmar, displaced, marginalized, and conflict-affected people have the capacity and support to claim respect for, protection of, and fulfillment of their rights
- At-risk communities in Myanmar have access to safe and comprehensive protection services
- The basic needs of people in Myanmar are met
-  People in Myanmar have more decent and sustainable livelihoods
- In Myanmar and Bangladesh, local civil society organisations are more sustainable and able to support partners&#x2019; capacity, agency, and ability to leverage change and respond to needs</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving the protective environment for and self-reliance of affected populations across the Myanmar displacement axis

Please refer to DRC&apos;s Open Information Policy regarding publication of financial and project level data for this programme</narrative>
